    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d926-a3">

                <pb facs="1082" n="1002" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1002"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McGregor to Mr.
                            Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >His Britannic Majesty’s Agency and Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Sofia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1902-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic">September
                                20, 1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my dispatch of
                    yesterday’s date, I have the honor to report that, according to reliable
                    information received just as the bag is closing, Boris Saratoff left Sofia on
                    the 15th instant en route for Odessa, a fact which must have been known to the
                    acting minister for foreign affairs when I attended his reception on the 18th
                    instant.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James McGregor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
